on.com/blogs/machine-learning/nvidia-nemotron-3-5-super-vl-is-now-available-in-amazon-sagemaker-jumpstart/","publishedAt":"2026-11-09T20:01:20.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/8fa81ac2ff0525230e8911420f78dddc59d19d1503d8084f830acaedebb138ee.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp 96w","itemId":"is28cob65a2xhrltq5hgsjnn6","title":"英国监管机构威胁对未采用AI防护考试形式的高校实施制裁","summary":"英国高等教育监管机构OfS威胁对未采用AI防护考试形式的高校实施制裁。OfS与第三方机构联合调查显示127所高校中超过300个教学单位存在学生使用AI完成论文且成绩与人工撰写无显著差异的问题，部分学生甚至通过ChatGPT完成整篇论文后无法回忆基础内容。","sourceName":"The Decoder","sourceUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/uk-regulator-threatens-universities-with-sanctions-unless-they-adopt-ai-proof-exam-formats/","publishedAt":"2026-11-11T11:54:46.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/c46d0ade22dfac4500486e6b9fe578a12b5b29f4700a8185057ce805e7bc1ee7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp 96w","itemId":"kks1tp5vorkir67sgz7lwd1o8","title":"AWS SageMaker AI 推出基于使用量的计费模式","summary":"AWS SageMaker AI 推出基于使用量的计费模式，支持实时双向流推理的按秒计费。客户通过AWS Marketplace订阅Deepgram等模型时，软件费用按实际音频处理量（如720秒对应12分钟）计收，基础设施费用仍单独计算。","sourceName":"AWS Machine Learning Blog","sourceUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/introducing-usage-based-pricing-for-amazon-sagemaker-ai-bidirectional-streaming/","publishedAt":"2026-11-11T15:10:23.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/8fa81ac2ff0525230e8911420f78dddc59d19d1503d8084f830acaedebb138ee.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp 96w","itemId":"dt3urf5lbe93e756rbg2xvyv2","title":"Google DeepMind发布AlphaProof Code工具，四周完成Signal加密协议验证","summary":"Google DeepMind发布AlphaProof Code工具，四周完成Signal加密协议验证，并实现自动化漏洞检测。该工具通过AI agents编写验证代码，覆盖六百万行代码，标记约1%需人工审查，并成功识别预植测试漏洞。","sourceName":"The Decoder","sourceUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/google-deepminds-alphaproof-code-verified-signals-cryptographic-core-in-four-weeks-instead-of-years/","publishedAt":"2026-11-11T18:18:25.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/8fa81ac2ff0525230e8911420f78dddc59d19d1503d8084f830acaedebb138ee.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp 96w","itemId":"guk114ayhjdqmy2r31tocgq6k","title":"OpenAI企业销售推动季度营收达10亿美元但仍落后Anthropic","summary":"OpenAI 2026年第三季度营收达10亿美元（同比增长约50%），调整后运营亏损扩大至-109%，仍落后于计划IPO的Anthropic（Q3营收17亿美元，亏损567百万美元）。","sourceName":"The Decoder","sourceUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/enterprise-sales-push-openais-quarterly-revenue-to-10-billion-though-it-still-trails-anthropic/","publishedAt":"2026-11-11T12:12:47.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/8fa81ac2ff0525230e8911420f78dddc59d19d1503d8084f830acaedebb138ee.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp 96w","itemId":"wp4jw5tozghwvwuenxvh2ov8b","title":"DeepL 推出实时翻译新模型 Aure，支持捕捉说话者的语气、情感和语速","summary":"DeepL 推出实时翻译新模型 Aure，支持捕捉说话者的语气、情感和语速。该模型通过分离语音身份、语调旋律和内容进行独立翻译，并利用强化学习避免输出口音。目前支持英语、德语、西班牙语等8种语言，已应用于 DeepL Voice for Online Meetings 等场景。DeepL 此前收购音频流媒体团队 Mixhalo 以强化实时语音翻译能力。","sourceN